  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A photograph of a midtown Manhattan street near Central Park overlaid with a tangle of thin rainbow scribble lines, where pedestrians and a pedicab rider have blank cartoon faces, signed 2023.",
    "description": "A portrait format digital piece on a photograph, signed 2023 at lower right. Tall office towers line both sides of a street receding to a teal and white sky. A web of thin scribbled lines in red, green, yellow and blue is drawn across the entire image, densest on the building facades, like coloured wire. In the foreground at left a pedicab with two passengers and a rider, all with blank skin toned faces and outlined bodies, waits at the crosswalk. At right an older couple walk toward the viewer, one in a cream shirt with a cane and one in a blue jacket with a bag, with blank faces. Across the street a crowd of small faceless figures waits at the corner, with outlined grey rocks or cars at the curb and trees redrawn as green outlines.",
    "impression": "The city seen through a nest of coloured scribble, as if the air itself were drawn on. The couple walking arm in arm with a cane are the emotional centre, two blank faces that read as tender anyway. The scribble layer is a different kind of mark from the flat fills and gives this one a nervous energy the others lack.",
